TI  - Effect of the management of seed flows and mode of propagation on the genetic diversity in an Andean farming system: the case of oca (Oxalis tuberosa Mol.)
PY  - 2016
T2  - Agriculture and Human Values
VL  - 33
IS  - 3
SP  - 673
